null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_5","text":"Ade also mentioned that it's better not to add appas.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_6","text":"She also stressed how it's important that it be appealing to whoever is meant to be eating it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_7","text":"Still, it would probably be better to make it big enough so that it's at least fulfilling, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_8","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_8","text":"A moment later","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_9","text":"How's it going, Emilia?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["soda"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_10","text":"Almost done.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_11","text":"Do you mind if I taste it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_12","text":"Hehe, you're an impatient one. Here, try it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_13","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_13","text":"Soda tastes the omelette.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_14","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_14","text":"It has been cooked for a long time, so it's a bit hard, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_15","text":"It's delicious! On top of that, it looks like a proper omelette.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_girlstalk","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_16","text":"The size is still... a bit formidable,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_17","text":"but there isn't an eggshell in sight, and the ingredients are all chopped up nicely and finely.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_18","text":"I made sure I didn't put in too many ingredients.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_19","text":"I chopped the ingredients finely so that it would be easier to eat, and I tried hard to make it look appetizing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_20","text":"I thought that it would feel nice if they ate a lot so I did make a bit too much...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_21","text":"That's all right, that means you're showing consideration for your masters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_22","text":"Congratulations, you've successfully conveyed your emotions through your cooking.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"soda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_23","text":"However, the next time, it would be better to dial it back on how much you make. It's true that you want the customer leaving satisfied, but overeating is never a good thing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"cocoa","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_24","text":"In serving, speed is essential.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["cocoa","maleguest","femaleguest"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_25","text":"Understood. Leave it to me!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_26","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_26","text":"Emilia quickly starts serving the orders coming out of the kitchen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_27","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_27","text":"Shortly after...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_28","text":"Can't be too slow... but I also can't make the customers feel uncomfortable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_29","text":"Is this the last of what was ordered?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleguest","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_30","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_31","text":"Okay, next up is... here you are! Enjoy your meal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_32","text":"Sorry to keep you waiting!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleguest","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_33","text":"My goodness, you're such a bundle of energy! Thank you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_34","text":"Sorry if I startled you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleguest","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_35","text":"Oh no, not at all. It's nice to see you so lively.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_36","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce_003_02_05_36","text":"Emilia maintains a decent speed when serving customers, but not so fast that she starts to ignore them.","jump"